{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06463","headline":"送东阳王太守 · 李颀","name":"送东阳王太守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江臯杜蘅绿，芳草日迟迟。\n桧楫今何去，星郎出守时。\n彤襜问风俗，明主寄惸嫠。\n令下不徒尔，人和当在兹。\n昔年经此地，微月有佳期。\n洞口桂花白，岩前春草滋。\n素沙静津濑，青壁带川坻。\n野鹤每孤立，林鼯常昼悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}